        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yongcheon High School, Turned into a Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the prestigious Yongcheon High School, an old ghost story has been whispered for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that at midnight on a full moon, <strong>the cries of schoolgirls echo from the sealed occult club room in the basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, four students performed a forbidden ritual and awakened the sealed spirits, plunging the school into a labyrinth of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must fight through this endless midnight self-study, facing the spirits that haunt the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans That Pierce Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have inherited shamanic power, allowing them to wield talismans. Fire projectiles that ricochet off walls and objects to strike talismans in a unique combat system, and banish the spirits that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans &amp; Relics: Endless Deckbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cleared battle rewards you with forbidden talismans. Combine talismans and mysterious relics to forge a cursed deck. With the school changing every run, your choices will decide whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Distinct Students</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haneul (Archery Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sumi (Kendo Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arin (Chemistry Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirae (Track &amp; Field)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character wields a unique weapon and fighting style, offering different tactical approaches to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore and School Ghost Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are more than simple spirits. Ghosts from <strong>Korean school ghost stories</strong> and traditional folklore manifest into reality. In dark classrooms, endless corridors, and sealed chambers, you will face beings once thought to exist only in legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main chapters to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 talismans and relics to build your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique characters with distinct weapon styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinthine school structure that changes every run, with spirits that grow stronger over time</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yongcheon High School, Turned into a Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the prestigious Yongcheon High School, an old ghost story has been whispered for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that at midnight on a full moon, <strong>the cries of schoolgirls echo from the sealed occult club room in the basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, four students performed a forbidden ritual and awakened the sealed spirits, plunging the school into a labyrinth of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must fight through this endless midnight self-study, facing the spirits that haunt the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans That Pierce Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have inherited shamanic power, allowing them to wield talismans. Fire projectiles that ricochet off walls and objects to strike talismans in a unique combat system, and banish the spirits that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans &amp; Relics: Endless Deckbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cleared battle rewards you with forbidden talismans. Combine talismans and mysterious relics to forge a cursed deck. With the school changing every run, your choices will decide whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Distinct Students</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haneul (Archery Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sumi (Kendo Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arin (Chemistry Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirae (Track &amp; Field)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character wields a unique weapon and fighting style, offering different tactical approaches to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore and School Ghost Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are more than simple spirits. Ghosts from <strong>Korean school ghost stories</strong> and traditional folklore manifest into reality. In dark classrooms, endless corridors, and sealed chambers, you will face beings once thought to exist only in legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.poster.avif?t=1773810712\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.webm?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823430/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.mp4?t=1773810712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main chapters to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 talismans and relics to build your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique characters with distinct weapon styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinthine school structure that changes every run, with spirits that grow stronger over time</p></li></ul>",
